      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just finished my shift and i feel like i'm literally disappearing. every day is just scanning boxes, walking the same floor, seeing the same faces. it doesn't even feel like i'm a person anymore, just like a part of the machinery. if i stopped showing up tomorrow, they'd have someone else in my spot before my paycheck even cleared. it feels so pointless.",
