      "content": "thanks but self care doesn't really change the fact that the cycle just repeats every single morning. it's like sisyphus or something. no matter what i do, i'm just pushing the same heavy rock up the hill only to watch it roll right back down. it feels like there is no actual way to win or even to change the outcome. everything is just... predetermined by the system.",
