    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesn't matter if my \"internal life\" exists if it's just spent being used up by something that doesn't care. the internal stuff is just what makes the burnout hurt more. i feel like there's no real way to exert any actual control or power over my life when the system is this big and this designed to keep me in this exact loop. it's like i'm just waiting for the clock to run out anyway.",
